{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0114_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b812bf594f646049c991ee2b734d127dbc2e48ca5d17f276aad2527085ff4f39", "ja": "（いよいよ、ライブツアーの公演が始まる！\nさて、恵美の様子はどうだろう……？）", "zh": "（演唱会巡回公演终于要正式开始了！\n好了，不晓得惠美的状况怎么样了……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0114_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "d4ba6f1727c4bd1f3c402473eab808711d1c22ae54db3e0ad9aa85a2f47c1634", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\nちょうどいいところに！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n你来得正好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0114_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "d4fc3bfd7a2e88a10f811bcbbd15c0327be424effc5bf4353090bed0961e5843", "ja": "大変大変、マジでやばいって！\nうう～……アタシ今日、ステージできないかも！", "zh": "糟糕糟糕，真的大事不妙啊！\n呜呜～我今天搞不好不能表演了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0114_1003_p", "source_sha256": "e4bd899b8db83009dcdb7a31d9f4cdb899a59ae2f106ab176ecf6026e41a1134", "ja": "恵美、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "惠美，你怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0114_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "a656d953dc5a5a3ebc944475de138ae726644e951e532e71255f98da2eca3215", "ja": "それがさ、聞いてよ～！\nアタシたち3人、ホテルの部屋が隣同士だったじゃん？", "zh": "你快听我说～！\n我们三个人在饭店不是彼此就住在隔壁房吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0114_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "acb8bfb9edbfbc6c0f5e2aab2a42b8485c14167a4e5f01e203f96f3b83949097", "ja": "夜3人でアタシの部屋に集まって、\n女子会っぽいコトしてたんだけど……。", "zh": "昨天晚上我们三个一起聚集在我的房间，\n做了类似女孩聚会的事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0114_1006_p", "source_sha256": "32868c809885c1ebab89215110661bfc3bedbf0c8fa4951b95d29c49df6038b9", "ja": "そんな事してたのか……。\nそれで、はしゃぎ過ぎて寝不足だとか？", "zh": "原来你们还做了这种事啊……\n那么，你是玩太晚所以没睡饱吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0114_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "5bfc0f89c57ce436b0c54506bdefebb1555a980e3a8583f93723e473a4a8bcfa", "ja": "そんな小学生みたいなことしないって！\nライブの前なんだから！", "zh": "谁会犯那种小学生才会出的错啊！\n隔天就是演唱会了耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0114_1008_p", "source_sha256": "9fc9d0548eaf94f8bac5a2afa1a7d1ef98721b7997e9caa5f90e158fa8725408", "ja": "そうか、えらいぞ！\n……じゃあ、何が問題なんだ？", "zh": "这样啊，好棒好棒！\n……那不然是有什么问题啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0114_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "121fe8d33817d560a6e4745eca41756079f05991196cd73ec0d10d2e4e8cf03e", "ja": "うん。さっきエレナが、\n昨日みんなで撮った画像を送ってくれたんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯，刚才艾琳娜她\n传来了大家昨天一起拍的照片……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0114_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "c9d2b3de870a9ed7efca84b849cc6a56f41e283eaf2676309bea80854bdebd20", "ja": "それが、めっちゃカワイく撮れててさ！\nすっごく楽しかったの、思い出しちゃって……。", "zh": "那张照片真的拍得非常可爱！\n让我想起昨天跟大家玩得好开心好开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0114_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "83bda9b07c34a659a65cf0e7837c2e0074295dc1b35d8f6a6fe1b942ba2506b3", "ja": "さっきから、ニヤニヤが止まらないんだよ～！\nどうしよ、もうすぐライブなのに！", "zh": "所以我从刚才就一直笑咪咪的停不下来啊～！\n怎么办，演唱会就要开始了啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0114_1012_p", "source_sha256": "24e82dca90ce5c4e0d47c3a6577dbb7b1b217876fbf59aea50c0503a903b1692", "ja": "……。\n楽しかったなら、別にいいんじゃないのか……？", "zh": "……\n玩得开心是有什么好在意的呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0114_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "8da05569c87aeb326ddfd1d1923c9fe556d83e84bf09975df60b06bfa951224b", "ja": "ダメダメ～！　全然よくないってば！\nこんなニヤけた顔、お客さんに見せられないよ～！", "zh": "不行不行～！这怎么可以啊！\n这样笑咪咪的脸，怎么能让观众们看呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0114_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "63c7a35731a53f3a807702ac2c378668b9ec49c04a0d780551149db94cecb40f", "ja": "アタシ、今回はビシッと決めたいのに！\nそれにこのままじゃ、真剣なふたりにも悪いじゃん！", "zh": "我已经决定这次要有帅气的表现了！\n而且这样下去，我也对不起那么投入的另外两个人啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0114_1015_p", "source_sha256": "7cbce3e709650fb4b0184a8c007caba032f4d1aea6c22809c1b6d7e68bcd83b5", "ja": "うーん……。\n恵美が幸せそうなら、ふたりは嬉しいんじゃないか？", "zh": "嗯……\n我倒是觉得只要惠美开心，她们也会很高兴耶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0114_1016_p", "source_sha256": "922a739ce9f25252cf4846d90824df449a17a474fa31dd31f55684165f0de924", "ja": "恵美だって、琴葉とエレナが幸せそうにしてたら、\n嬉しいって思うだろ？", "zh": "假设立场对调，惠美你看到琴叶和艾琳娜笑得很开心，\n你也会替她们感到高兴不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0114_1017_020meg", "source_sha256": "649a9db82ca26a54ccc5c369741f431a6eebd8cb83f715a3f73bfb88a2b23846", "ja": "えっ？　……ま、まあ。\nそれは、そうかもしれないけど……。", "zh": "咦？是、是啦……\n或许是这样没错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0114_1018_p", "source_sha256": "4a9c8478abaa81fcfce8756ef13338fd01853d05363535b6e90eab0572d394c6", "ja": "変にごまかしたりしないで、自然な笑顔を\nみんなに見てもらおう。普段の恵美の笑顔をな。", "zh": "不需要刻意去掩饰什么，就让大家看看\n惠美最自然的、平常就会露出的笑脸吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0114_1019_020meg", "source_sha256": "a5215e6bb95af6f1d2083c55dc095d92a48078ecf62e2050a7b9547bcac49c2d", "ja": "普段のアタシの笑顔……そっか。アタシ、今回は\nカッコよくなきゃって、ちょっと思いすぎてたかな。", "zh": "我平常的笑脸……这样啊。\n我这次可能是太纠结在帅气这点上了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0114_1020_020meg", "source_sha256": "b74756fa8ebc00c90cf19fa8d941686abd5ef2d90ee5a07eb4d25ddf45f24381", "ja": "わかったよ、{$P$}！\nみんながつられて笑っちゃうくらい、笑ってくる！", "zh": "我知道了，{$P$}！\n我要开怀大笑，笑到大家也会跟我一起露出笑容！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0114_1021_p", "source_sha256": "0d28f6b0550b5c5fc943f0f654ee88f842e39ee2ab70ba9d38f618356ee82756", "ja": "そうだな、それがいいよ。", "zh": "嗯，这样就对了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0114_1022_020meg", "source_sha256": "6951e72a52e520adace58f1db4820fceff2ef8a4983a0f1d2cd56c05056bc1b3", "ja": "あっ。そういえば昨日の夜、\n{$P$}の話でチョー盛り上がってさ！", "zh": "啊，说起来昨天晚上，我们聊到\n{$P$}的事情聊得非常起劲喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0114_1023_020meg", "source_sha256": "057d60b159e3dca2d33184672483bb7758ff1ac17af27e1c3d5c36a2dba476ec", "ja": "すっごく楽しかったから、MCで話すといいかも？\n琴葉とエレナに相談してみよ～っと！", "zh": "因为真的聊得很开心，所以在主持时可能会讲出来喔。\n我去找琴叶还有艾琳娜商量一下好了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0114_1024_020meg", "source_sha256": "8f5b5d9c7a985c546975ba3c1ada202761fa02c8e3f73637b4e7344a5063ef7f", "ja": "{$P$}、ありがと！\nまたあとでね～！", "zh": "{$P$}，谢谢你！\n我们等会见～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0114_1025_p", "source_sha256": "bae7cc6a867a252d5d390eba42e1691c11e68b31164baa066c6ef1f3f6c9a0c6", "ja": "えっ！？　いや、俺は裏方だし……\nというか、どんな話をしたんだ？　おーい、恵美～！", "zh": "咦！？别啦，我只是个幕后人员……\n是说你们到底聊了什么啊？喂──惠美～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
